    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a slice-of-life rollerblading adventure. In <strong>RollerGirl</strong>, play as 16-year-old Naomi. Her MP3 player holds tracks from curated playlists. The music you choose shapes the environment, dialogue choices, and your skating style. Talk to your neighbours, get entangled in local shenanigans, and discover town mysteries in this cozy coming of age game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHAPE THE WORLD THROUGH MUSIC</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With  your MP3 player, you can change the way you experience the world. Set the mood, alter the visuals, and shape the world as you shuffle through your 2000s inspired playlist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/962f3a485d469948f86664d48158b873.poster.avif?t=1754943039\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/962f3a485d469948f86664d48158b873.webm?t=1754943039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/962f3a485d469948f86664d48158b873.mp4?t=1754943039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ROLLERBLADE ACROSS TOWN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on your rollerblades and navigate the scenic streets of your small town. Practice your moves, relax with the flowy movement, and find your place within the neighbourhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/025c5aa0c6c21f01f88661757e9af67c.poster.avif?t=1754943039\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/025c5aa0c6c21f01f88661757e9af67c.webm?t=1754943039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/025c5aa0c6c21f01f88661757e9af67c.mp4?t=1754943039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A FORMATIVE ADVENTURE</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn enough money to fix up your car by doing odd jobs for your eclectic neighbours. Run errands, uncover lost items, strike up fun conversations, and get swept up in shenanigans with local troublemakers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/e9879a54e810861d3065321c84953a14.poster.avif?t=1754943039\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/e9879a54e810861d3065321c84953a14.webm?t=1754943039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/e9879a54e810861d3065321c84953a14.mp4?t=1754943039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kinds of small town adventures will you discover?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a slice-of-life rollerblading adventure. In <strong>RollerGirl</strong>, play as 16-year-old Naomi. Her MP3 player holds tracks from curated playlists. The music you choose shapes the environment, dialogue choices, and your skating style. Talk to your neighbours, get entangled in local shenanigans, and discover town mysteries in this cozy coming of age game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHAPE THE WORLD THROUGH MUSIC</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With  your MP3 player, you can change the way you experience the world. Set the mood, alter the visuals, and shape the world as you shuffle through your 2000s inspired playlist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/962f3a485d469948f86664d48158b873.poster.avif?t=1754943039\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/962f3a485d469948f86664d48158b873.webm?t=1754943039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/962f3a485d469948f86664d48158b873.mp4?t=1754943039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ROLLERBLADE ACROSS TOWN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on your rollerblades and navigate the scenic streets of your small town. Practice your moves, relax with the flowy movement, and find your place within the neighbourhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/025c5aa0c6c21f01f88661757e9af67c.poster.avif?t=1754943039\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/025c5aa0c6c21f01f88661757e9af67c.webm?t=1754943039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/025c5aa0c6c21f01f88661757e9af67c.mp4?t=1754943039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A FORMATIVE ADVENTURE</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn enough money to fix up your car by doing odd jobs for your eclectic neighbours. Run errands, uncover lost items, strike up fun conversations, and get swept up in shenanigans with local troublemakers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/e9879a54e810861d3065321c84953a14.poster.avif?t=1754943039\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/e9879a54e810861d3065321c84953a14.webm?t=1754943039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/e9879a54e810861d3065321c84953a14.mp4?t=1754943039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kinds of small town adventures will you discover?</p>",
    "short_description": "A narrative adventure about a summer spent rollerblading in the mid-2000s. Explore a quiet town as Naomi, a teenage girl looking for an escape. Your in-game MP3 player isn't just for music; its playlist shapes the world &amp; story as you run errands for quirky neighbours / get entangled in local drama.",
